From 0748f05ce73637bd3c996fd306d2e3b97216b534 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Neil Munoz <theia3impact@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 23 Aug 2026 01:14:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(security): close auth, XSS and notify review holes

Fail closed on missing production admin/API secrets, sanitize contact
bodies before persist/notify, surface notify failures as pending, and
rate-limit on cookie+IP instead of x-forwarded-for alone.
